WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:06.516 --> 00:00:08.516
♪♪

00:00:08.798 --> 00:00:10.719
KRAGLIN
I just saw on the calendar that right now

00:00:10.769 --> 00:00:12.746
on Earth it's almost Christmas time.

00:00:12.936 --> 00:00:13.818
NEBULA
We don't have time for

00:00:13.868 --> 00:00:15.474
trivialities like Christmas.

00:00:15.810 --> 00:00:17.377
MANTIS
But Peter's so sad about

00:00:17.428 --> 00:00:18.700
Gamora being gone.

00:00:19.004 --> 00:00:21.004
♪♪

00:00:21.313 --> 00:00:23.583
MANTIS
Maybe if we go to Earth for a really

00:00:23.685 --> 00:00:24.942
wonderful Christmas gift...

00:00:25.827 --> 00:00:27.082
...it would make him happy.

00:00:32.677 --> 00:00:34.028
[Cheering]

00:00:34.535 --> 00:00:36.763
MANTIS
Something special he will never forget.

00:00:37.694 --> 00:00:39.404
DRAX
What about someone special?

00:00:43.623 --> 00:00:44.503
MANTIS
We’re looking for the

00:00:44.553 --> 00:00:46.193
legendary Kevin Bacon.

00:00:46.243 --> 00:00:47.130
DRAX
We're looking for the

00:00:47.180 --> 00:00:48.795
legendary Kevin Bacon!

00:00:48.845 --> 00:00:49.970
MANTIS
I just said that, Drax!

00:00:50.021 --> 00:00:51.084
DRAX
But your voice is small and mousey,

00:00:51.134 --> 00:00:51.994
I think maybe he didn't hear you.

00:00:53.167 --> 00:00:53.971
[Screams]

00:00:55.730 --> 00:00:56.526
DRAX
You're coming with us...

00:00:56.935 --> 00:00:57.933
...as a Christmas present.

00:00:59.318 --> 00:01:01.318
♪♪

00:01:04.183 --> 00:01:05.198
GROOT
I am Groot!

